  "definitions": {
   "archived_lineup": "The lineup that maximises the archived forecasts over the decision set in the league's starting slots the source covers (ties: lower player id). Rule decision-feedback.v1.",
   "call": "For each filled slot s with starter x, the alternative y is the benched decision-set player eligible for s with the highest archived forecast. The call is 'start x over y'. A slot with no eligible benched player has no call.",
   "coverage": "decision-set players / (decision-set players + players without a pregame forecast or known kickoff).",
   "decision_set": "Players on your roster snapshot taken before the week's first kickoff, not in the IR slot, whose team plays that week and who have a forecast from the source archived before their own kickoff.",
   "exclusions": "Missing data is never zero: players and calls without an archived input or a recorded outcome are excluded and counted by reason.",
   "forecast_error": "error = actual - forecast per decision-set player with recorded points; MAE = mean |error|, bias = mean error. Your roster only.",
   "forecast_gap": "forecast(x) - forecast(y) >= 0. A call with a gap under 3 points is a close call: a miss there is not a confident miss.",
   "hit_rate": "correct / (correct + missed); pushes and excluded calls are left out. Unknown when no call is decided.",
   "lineup": "archived = actual points of the archived lineup; best = the most points any lineup from the same decision set and slots scored; archive_shortfall = best - archived (>= 0). Only when every decision-set player has recorded points. yours = actual points of your final starters in those slots (only when all are recorded).",
   "margin": "margin = actual(x) - actual(y), in league points, rounded to 0.01.",
   "opportunity_cost": "lower = max(0, actual(y) - actual(x)): points lost against the archive's own alternative. upper = max(0, max over every eligible benched b of actual(b) - actual(x)): points lost against the best alternative in hindsight. lower <= upper. upper is unknown when an eligible benched player has no recorded points.",
   "verdict": "Correct if margin > 0, missed if margin < 0, push if margin = 0."
  },
